    "caveat": "The ratio is our own calculation: active subscriptions divided by cumulative deliveries, which Tesla defines as all new vehicles delivered to customers plus any unsupervised Robotaxis placed into commercial operation. Older cars leave the fleet and some owners use FSD on a car they bought secondhand, so it is a proxy for take rate, not a figure Tesla reports."
